      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel exhausted by the sheer weight of the system, and the thought of \"exiting\" can feel like the only logical escape from the relentless pressure. If the current path is leading only to further depletion, perhaps the concept of \"winning\" doesn't have to be a massive confrontation, but a radical act of self-preservation. Sometimes, the most powerful refusal is simply to stop participating in the self-erasing narrative, even if only for a moment.",
